  <diagram id="astro-artifact-1" name="01 — Credential-separated artifact retrieval">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="760" grid="1" gridSize="10" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1200" pageHeight="760">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="title" value="01 — Credential-separated artifact retrieval" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=27;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#142B3A;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="25" width="1120" height="45" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="subtitle" value="An Owner action checks one exact candidate; the signed download never receives the GitHub token." style="text;html=0;align=left;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=15;fontColor=#43566B;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="78" width="1120" height="42" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="b1" value="01  Owner confirmation&#10;&#10;Successful retained run observation&#10;Verify candidate content explicitly&#10;Opening / refresh reads SQL only&#10;No caller URL, file or artifact ID" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=20;fillColor=#F3F8FC;strokeColor=#8AA8C0;fontColor=#142B3A;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="140" width="340" height="210" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="b2" value="02  SQL preflight and release&#10;&#10;Current Owner + source + target&#10;Exact observation / frozen request&#10;Replay exact retained proof locally&#10;Release locks before network I/O" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=20;fillColor=#F3F8FC;strokeColor=#8AA8C0;fontColor=#142B3A;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="430" y="140" width="340" height="210" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="b3" value="03  Authenticated GitHub reads&#10;&#10;Exact successful first-run metadata&#10;One named unexpired artifact&#10;Fixed artifact API ZIP endpoint&#10;Private token stays at api.github.com" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=20;fillColor=#F3F8FC;strokeColor=#8AA8C0;fontColor=#142B3A;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="820" y="140" width="340" height="210" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="b4" value="04  Credential-free ZIP client&#10;&#10;Validated HTTPS artifact service host&#10;No Authorization / Cookie / Referer&#10;Pin only public DNS answers&#10;No proxy or secondary redirects" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=20;fillColor=#F3F8FC;strokeColor=#8AA8C0;fontColor=#142B3A;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="820" y="405" width="340" height="210" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="b5" value="05  Whole-byte + content checks&#10;&#10;Exact compressed size / SHA-256&#10;Portable inventory; all file CRCs&#10;Independent Go EN / ID facts&#10;Recheck artifact and run metadata" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=20;fillColor=#F3F8FC;strokeColor=#8AA8C0;fontColor=#142B3A;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="430" y="405" width="340" height="210" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="b6" value="06  Immutable content proof&#10;&#10;Current Owner / source / revision&#10;Proof + actor audit commit together&#10;Record reviewed code + ZIP hashes&#10;Deployment and publication pending" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=20;fillColor=#F3F8FC;strokeColor=#8AA8C0;fontColor=#142B3A;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1">
