  <diagram id="astro-artifact-2" name="02 — In-memory archive and frozen facts">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="760" grid="1" gridSize="10" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1200" pageHeight="760">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="title" value="02 — In-memory archive and frozen facts" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=27;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#142B3A;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="25" width="1120" height="45" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="subtitle" value="No member is extracted, executed, served or fetched as a secondary asset." style="text;html=0;align=left;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=15;fontColor=#43566B;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="78" width="1120" height="42" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="b1" value="01  Bounded ZIP envelope&#10;&#10;8 MiB compressed; 32 MiB expanded&#10;At most 256 archive entries&#10;128 KiB central directory preflight&#10;Single disk; ordinary end records" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=20;fillColor=#F3F8FC;strokeColor=#8AA8C0;fontColor=#142B3A;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="140" width="340" height="210" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="b2" value="02  Portable member inventory&#10;&#10;No traversal / absolute / drive paths&#10;No symlinks or special files&#10;No case / duplicate / parent conflicts&#10;No private dot roots except marker" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=20;fillColor=#F3F8FC;strokeColor=#8AA8C0;fontColor=#142B3A;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="430" y="140" width="340" height="210" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="b3" value="03  Stream every regular file&#10;&#10;Plain Store / Deflate methods only&#10;Actual size and CRC must match&#10;Cancellation / aggregate byte limits&#10;No filesystem extraction or execution" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=20;fillColor=#F3F8FC;strokeColor=#8AA8C0;fontColor=#142B3A;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="820" y="140" width="340" height="210" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="b4" value="04  Select exact public documents&#10;&#10;index.html and id/index.html&#10;.well-known public content marker&#10;Each HTML ≤ 1 MiB; marker ≤ 8192 B&#10;Other files: integrity, not semantics" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=20;fillColor=#F3F8FC;strokeColor=#8AA8C0;fontColor=#142B3A;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="820" y="405" width="340" height="210" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="b5" value="05  Go derives frozen expected facts&#10;&#10;Server-approved project / Profile&#10;Exact identity / links / order / absence&#10;Literal visitor content in EN and ID&#10;Marker/hash alone is not authority" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=20;fillColor=#F3F8FC;strokeColor=#8AA8C0;fontColor=#142B3A;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="430" y="405" width="340" height="210" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="b6" value="06  Genuine compiled fixture proof&#10;&#10;Initial / updated / empty real builds&#10;Independent and signed-source modes&#10;Real ZIP and Go protocol checks&#10;Synthetic provider, no hosted claim" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=20;fillColor=#F3F8FC;strokeColor=#8AA8C0;fontColor=#142B3A;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="405" width="340" height="210" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="footer" value="M5m · 7 November 2026 · Migration 00024 · Candidate content proof only · Astro publication stays pending" style="text;html=0;align=left;fontSize=14;fontColor=#43566B;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="665" width="1120" height="45" as="geometry" />
